t  here are the skills you will require to  become a data analyst  sql statistical knowledge  knowledge of programming data analysts  must have hands-on experience with  programming languages such as  python and r writing programs will help  you solve complex problems  critical thinking knowledge of data  visualization tools  a data analyst must create different  business reports using  several visualization tools  understanding of statistics and machine  learning algorithms  you must know concepts like probability  distributions  hypothesis testing etc some other  essential skills include  presentation skills microsoft excel  writing and communication skills coming  to the roles and responsibilities of  data and list  first and foremost a data analyst must  identify the organization's goal  they must assess the available resources  comprehend the business problem and  collect the right data  so a data analyst will be collecting  and interpreting data write complex sql  queries and scripts  to gather store manipulate  and retrieve information from relational  databases  data mining data is mined from many  sources  and organized to obtain new details from  it  by doing so data models are built to  increase the efficiency of the system  and then we have data cleansing data  examining  preparing summary reports and  collaborating with other teams  talking about the average salaries of a  data analyst in india and the united  states  according to glassdoor in india a data  analyst  can earn approximately 5 lakh rupees per  annum  and about 62 453 dollars per annum  in the united states if getting your  learning started is half the battle  what if you could do that for free visit  skill up by simply learn  click on the link in the description to  know more  next we have the role business analyst  the skills required for a business  analyst include  microsoft excel sql familiarity with  visualization tools  problem solving skills information  technology  analytic thinking and finally  interpersonal skills  to sum up you will need to have  technical skills communication skills  analytical skills decision making  capabilities  and managerial skills roles and  responsibilities of a business analyst  initially a business analyst must  determine the kpis  that is the key performance indicators  a business analyst engages with existing  and prospective customers  and helps them adopt products and  solutions to meet business requirements  they ensure consistent growth in product  awareness  adoption and usage by customers  a business analyst also design solution  that best meets the client's needs  to sum up a business analyst's roles and  responsibilities include  market research data gathering data  analysis  communication documentation and finally  recommendations  talking about the average salaries of a  business analyst in  india and the united states according to  glassdoor in  india a business analyst can earn  approximately  6 lakh 65 000 rupees per annum  in the united states they can earn  approximately  68 346 dollars per annum  up next on the list we have statistician  the skills required for statistician are  mathematical ability and computer  literacy  a clear understanding of statistical  terms and concepts  like other roles in the list you will  require good written  and oral communication skills problem  solving skills and finally  high level accuracy and attention to  details  roles and responsibilities of a  statistician  the specific tasks that statisticians  are expected to complete  daily will vary and depend on the  particular  industry and organization in which they  work but some of the general tasks  include  consulting with clients and agreeing on  what data to collect  and how it should be gathered  considering any ethical and legislative  considerations  designing experiments collecting and  analyzing data  monitoring the data collected throughout  its shelf life  a statistician often carries out  research  and write reports and articles for  publication  let's now talk about the average  salaries of a statistician in india  and the united states according to  glassdoor  in india a statistician can earn  approximately  5 lakh 14 000 rupees per annum  in the united states they can earn  approximately  76 884 dollars per annum  data architects the skills required for  a data architect  include applied math and statistics  they are needed for data architect  positions due to analytical reasoning  computation interpretation and data  presentation  to solve business problems data  architects are expected to have a deep  understanding of data visualization  and data migration foundational database  skills are a must  too like any other job role in the list  data architects must have programming  skills as well  some other essential skills include  hadoop technologies  like hive mapreduce and pig machine  learning  data mining and modeling tools  let's now talk about the roles and  responsibilities of a data architect  data architects build and maintain a  company's database  by identifying structural and  installation solutions  they communicate with different  companies stakeholders to assess their  needs and goals  plan end-to-end model for data  consumption and analysis  working with the databases is a huge  responsibility for a data architect  as they monitor and maintain databases  data architects also preserve a  repository of all data architecture  artifacts let's now talk about the  average salary of a data architect in  india and the united states according to  glass door in india  a data architect can earn approximately  18 lakh 83 000 rupees per annum  in the united states they can earn  approximately  one lakh eight thousand dollars per  annum  at last in the list we have data  engineers  the skills required for a data engineer  are  sql it serves as the fundamental skill  set for data  engineers you cannot manage an rtb ms  without mastering sql  data warehousing is another essential  skill that helps data engineers  aggregate unstructured data collected  from multiple sources  data architecture coding  to link your database and work with all  types of applications  like web mobile desktop you must improve  your programming skills  the other essential skills are machine  learning  and apache hadoop based analytics  talking about a data engineer's roles  and responsibilities  they are expected to perform the  following duties  work on data architecture they use a  systematic approach to plan  create and maintain data architectures  while also keeping them aligned with  business requirements  collect data they have to obtain data  from the right sources  before initiating any database work  researching to address any issues that  can arise  while tackling a business problem create  models  and identify patterns and finally  automate tasks talking about the average  salaries of a data engineer in india and  the united states  according to glassdoor in india a data  engineer can earn approximately  seven lakh rupees per annum in the  united states  they can earn approximately one lakh  three thousand dollars per annum  and by this we reached the end of this  video  think we missed any let us know in the  comment section below  we'll be back again with yet another  informative video  till then stay safe and keep learning  hi there if you like this video  subscribe to the simply learn youtube  channel  and click here to watch similar videos  turn it up and get certified  click here

